<title>UK: TENNIS-EASTBOURNE WOMEN'S GRASS-COURT TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-EASTBOURNE WOMEN'S GRASS-COURT TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>EASTBOURNE, England 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the Eastbourne women's grass-court tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>8-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) beat Helena Sukova (Czech Republic) 6-3 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Silvia Farina (Italy) beat Lisa Raymond (U.S.) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France) beat Lucie Ahl (Britain) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Naoko Sawamatsu (Japan) beat Jo Ward (Britain) 6-2 7-5</p>
<p>Kerry-Anne Guse (Australia) beat Wang Shi-ting (Taiwan) 6-3 5-7</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>6-Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat Ines Gorrochategui (Argentina) 6-0 3-6 6-4</p>
<p>Venus Williams (U.S.) beat Chanda Rubin (U.S.) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) beat Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) 6-3 6-0  </p>
<p>Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) beat Amy Frazier (U.S.) 7-6 (7-1) 6-0</p>
<p>7-Kimberley Po (U.S.) beat Katarina Studenikova (Slovakia) 0-6 7-6 (7-5) 6-2</p>
<p>Ai Sugiyama (Japan) beat Shirli-Ann Siddall (Britain) 6-2 5-7 8-6</p>
<p>Nathalie Tauziat (France) beat 5-Mary-Joe Fernandez (U.S.) 7-6 (7-5) 7-5</p>
</text>
